orter agreed and allowed him to share the mule with him. They came to a crossing on the way. The person said, ''Now, which road will you take?'' ''The main road, of course,'' replied the porter. The person said, ''No, brother. We should go by the", "ttsEligible": true, "verificationStatus": "in_review"}, {"id": "d0190000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002", "structuralNodeId": "a6200000-0000-4000-8000-000000000006", "sequenceIndex": 1, "blockType": "english", "languageCode": "en", "direction": "ltr", "textContent": "It is said in a hadith that when somebody is confronted with a need, whether pertaining to this life or the Hereafter, or whether it concerns Allah or a mortal, he should perform a perfect wudhu, offer salaat of two rakaats, glorify Allah, then ask blessing for the Prophet (Sallallaho alaihe wasallam), and then pray as under:", "rawOcrText": null, "ttsEligible": true, "verificationStatus": "in_review"}, {"id": "d0190000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003", "structuralNodeId": "a6200000-0000-4000-8000-000000000006", "sequenceIndex": 2, "blockType": "arabic", "languageCode": "ar", "direction": "rtl", "textContent": "لَا إِلٰهَ إِلَّا اللَّهُ الْحَلِيمُ الْكَرِيمُ سُبْحَانَ اللَّهِ رَبِّ الْعَرْشِ الْعَظِيمِ الْحَمْدُ لِلَّهِ رَبِّ الْعَالَمِينَ أَسْأَلُكَ مُوجِبَاتِ رَحْمَتِكَ وَعَزَائِمَ مَغْفِرَتِكَ وَالْغَنِيمَةَ مِنْ كُلِّ بِرٍّ وَالسَّلَامَةَ مِنْ كُلِّ إِثْمٍ لَا تَدَعْ لِي ذَنْبًا إِلَّا غَفَرْتَهُ وَلَا هَمًّا إِلَّا فَرَّجْتَهُ وَلَا حَاجَةً هِيَ لَكَ رِضًا إِلَّا قَضَيْتَهَا يَا أَرْحَمَ الرَّاحِمِينَ", "rawOcrText": null, "ttsEligible": true, "verificationStatus": "in_review"}, {"id": "d0190000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004", "structuralNodeId": "a6200000-0000-4000-8000-000000000006", "sequenceIndex": 3, "blockType": "translation", "languageCode": "en", "direction": "ltr", "textContent": "\"There is no god save Allah—the Clement—the Bountiful. Glorified be Allah, the Lord of the tremendous throne. Praise be to Allah, the Lord of the worlds. I ask Thee all that 